<concept_spec>

concept Feedback

purpose
    convert metrics into actionable lesson suggestions

state
    a set of Suggestions with
        a ts Number
        a suggestions Json

actions
    generate (avgStudentCount: Number, avgPhoneUsers: Number, phoneUseRatio: Number, rising: Boolean) : (ts: Number)
        produce suggestions and store them
        return ts

queries
    _latest () : (ts: Number, suggestions: Json)
        return the most recent suggestions

</concept_spec>

